  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_glacus",
      "name": {
        "en": "Glaucus's Badge",
        "zh": "格劳克斯证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Glaucus has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for impeding the enemy.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Supporter Operator during field operations to exercise Decel Binder responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员格劳克斯擅长牵制敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为辅助干员，行使凝滞师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_glacus",
      "name": {
        "en": "Powered Exoskeleton",
        "zh": "外骨骼装备",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_glacus",
      "description": {
        "en": "Not one person could put words to her joy in that moment.\nWhen Glaucus gets her hands on this suit, she doesn't have any particularly great expectations. She imagines it'll just enable her to walk a bit faster, stand a bit longer, give her a few more days in her life of feeling the sensation of the ground with her own two legs.\nShe's not all too clear on what kind of change it can bring into her life, but she's sure it beats a wheelchair, and it'll give her a bare minimum sort of comfort during the times she can use it—she'd like to be able to stand as long as she wishes, after all.\nFraction by fraction, she installs the exoskeleton around her legs. The ice-cold metal presses against her skin, and the straps bind her weakened leg muscles tight. She gives lifting one leg a try, against the heavy frame has her all the more unable to move her feet.\nShe's spent so long unable to run now.\n'Is this really going to do anything?'\nGlaucus whispers to herself. She's not sure; she's never touched this sort of technology before.\nA few years ago, when Glaucus learned her leg muscle atrophy was caused by a hereditary disease in her family, she still had hopes she'd be lucky, thinking how maybe it could be cured, that it was only serious for a tiny fraction of her family, and she wouldn't be so unfortunate.\nYet as the days went by, Glaucus realized nothing could prevent the gradual loss of strength in her legs, and all she could do was talk herself into accepting this, how it was bound to happen to her body sooner or later.\nBut today, abruptly, with an unwavering power, the exoskeleton braces her body. Hurriedly, Glaucus seizes on this force and stands up, nervousness overcoming her, the bloodrush as her heart violently pounds causing her to take a tiny step forward.\nThen comes a second.\nA third.\nA fourth.\nGlaucus walks through the door, this physically choking emotion surging through her head, squeezing all her reason out. She has a sudden urge to run that defies everything. Even though she still hasn't gotten a hold of her balance, she feels she's gotten a miraculous hold of everything.\nThe metal is ice-cold, steel-solid, and it braces her frail legs. She runs like the wind, runs for the endless world outside.",
        "zh": "无人能用语言描述她那一刻的欢欣。\n当格劳克斯拿到这副装备时，她并没有抱有多大的期待。她想，这些装备不过是能让自己走得更轻快一些，站得更长久一些，再用自己的双脚感受地面触感的日子更多一些。\n她并不是很清楚这副装备可以给自己带来怎样的转变，但可以确定的是它比轮椅要好，能在使用时给她一些聊胜于无的安慰——她也想能一直站着。\n她把这副外骨骼一点点装到自己的腿上，冰凉的金属贴上皮肤，扣带绷住她腿部软弱无力的肌肉，她试着抬了抬腿，沉重的支架让她更加无法挪动自己的双脚。\n她已经不能奔跑很久了。\n“这真的有用吗？”\n格劳克斯小声地问自己，她也不确定，她没有接触过这种科技产品。\n几年前，当格劳克斯得知自己肌肉萎缩软化的根源在于其家族遗传疾病后，她还在心怀侥幸，想着或许能够被治好，家族中只有极少数重症患者，自己不会如此不幸。\n可是当日子一天天过去，格劳克斯发现没有任何办法可以阻止她的双腿逐渐无力后，她只能说服自己接受这迟早会降临在自己身上的结局。\n但今天，这副外骨骼用一股突如其来的、源源不断的力量支撑起了她的身体。仓促间，格劳克斯借着这股力量猛地站了起来，剧烈心跳带来的血液猛冲促使她在忐忑间迈开了小小的一步。\n而后是第二步。\n第三步。\n第四步。\n格劳克斯走出房门，一阵呛鼻的情感涌上头脑，挤出了她所有理智。她不顾一切地想要奔跑起来，即便此刻的自己还没有掌握住平衡，但她已经觉得自己拥有了一切。\n这些金属冰冷、坚硬，它们支撑起她瘦小的双腿。她奔向风，奔向外面无尽的世界。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
